{"id":"wb-8-755","name":"太湖溇港","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太湖溇港","text":"太湖溇港是太湖东南岸一组水利系统的统称，曾分布于浙江湖州、嘉兴及江苏苏州、无锡地区。太湖溇港始建于春秋时期，经后世历代扩建、维修，形成了由运河𬱖塘、200多溇港、南北横塘等数条横塘及万顷圩田组成的水利体系，形成对太湖的调蓄功能。浙江湖州吴兴区境内保存的溇港水利系统最为完善，2017年1月13日成为浙江省文物保护单位，2019年10月7日成为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E6%B9%96%E6%BA%87%E6%B8%AF","revisionId":92159902,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92159902","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e275f5adbf4a5e7ffdabc0e8.jpg","title":"Map_and_introduction_of_Lougang_Irrigation_and_Drainage_System_of_Taihu_Lake_Basin.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Map_and_introduction_of_Lougang_Irrigation_and_Drainage_System_of_Taihu_Lake_Basin.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/Map_and_introduction_of_Lougang_Irrigation_and_Drainage_System_of_Taihu_Lake_Basin.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"源義信","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​太湖溇港介绍与地图。摄于杨渎港。","width":320,"height":240}}